    "title": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<p>Senior full stack software engineer specialized in <strong>Java</strong> (Quarkus, Spring Boot, Hibernate) on the backend and <strong>Next.js / React</strong> on the frontend. I design and deliver scalable cloud microservice architectures (Kubernetes, Docker, CI/CD), with strong expertise in observability, messaging (Kafka/RabbitMQ), and relational and NoSQL databases. I lead teams and drive products from requirements gathering to continuous delivery in production, in mission-critical domains such as healthcare and finance. As a key differentiator, I also work with AI and computer vision solutions (YOLO/TensorFlow).</p>"
  },
